WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.878 --> 00:00:04.938
In this video you'll set goals, and look back at what you've done.

2
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:11.850
On your home page, there's a box called My Goals. Type something you want to work on, and select Add.

3
00:00:12.351 --> 00:00:17.181
When you've done it, tick it off. The circle next to your goal fills with a check mark.

4
00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:23.303
Select My Goals and History at the top of the page to see more. There are two tabs.

5
00:00:23.805 --> 00:00:29.735
My Goals shows your open goals, and the ones you've finished. It feels good to see that list grow.

6
00:00:30.237 --> 00:00:36.867
Lesson History lists the lessons you've done. Select one to open it again, and look back at what you learned.

7
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:44.410
Keep your goals kind, and about you. There's a safety check on what's written. Great work. Keep going.
